WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.622
"Good morning, everyone," Mr. Icky said in Cooking class the next day.

2
00:00:11.623 --> 00:00:14.144
Mr. Freaky stood beside him.

3
00:00:14.145 --> 00:00:18.702
"Mr. Freaky has come to tell us some very exciting news."

4
00:00:18.703 --> 00:00:22.189
"Is school ending early today?" a ghoul asked.

5
00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:26.184
The students laughed.

6
00:00:26.185 --> 00:00:29.929
"No more monster math!" a witch shouted.

7
00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:32.565
"Yeah!" others cheered.

8
00:00:32.566 --> 00:00:35.017
Mr. Freaky held up his hands.

9
00:00:35.018 --> 00:00:37.625
"Everyone, please settle down!"

10
00:00:37.626 --> 00:00:44.640
He took out a handkerchief and blew his noses.

11
00:00:44.641 --> 00:00:48.408
"A popular cooking show is coming to our town this Friday.

12
00:00:48.409 --> 00:00:52.415
It's called Kids' Kitchen Showdown

13
00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:55.362
." "Cool!" a fish monster

14
00:00:55.363 --> 00:00:59.021
said. "I love that TV show!" the witch

15
00:00:59.022 --> 00:01:04.368
said. "But I wish the cooks made more good food like tarantula

16
00:01:04.369 --> 00:01:12.678
stew. They usually make food for people, like chocolate cake and something called

17
00:01:12.679 --> 00:01:15.015
lasagna." "Yeah," the ghoul

18
00:01:15.016 --> 00:01:18.316
said. "Why can't they cook more stuff for

19
00:01:18.356 --> 00:01:23.969
monsters?" Ben had watched Kids' Kitchen Showdown once or twice with his mom, but he didn't really like

20
00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:27.354
it. Why would anyone watch a show about

21
00:01:27.355 --> 00:01:29.756
cooking? Mr. Freaky wrung his

22
00:01:29.757 --> 00:01:33.306
hands. "The show was going to be filmed at People Place Middle

23
00:01:33.307 --> 00:01:38.132
School. But Mayor Hubbletree suggested they film it here at Monster

24
00:01:38.133 --> 00:01:42.717
Academy." "Mayor Hubbletree wants the show to be here?" Mr. Icky said.

25
00:01:42.718 --> 00:01:47.931
Ben saw a bead of sweat roll down Mr. Freaky's face.

26
00:01:47.932 --> 00:01:54.203
"The mayor wants the world to see that monsters and humans can get along," Mr. Freaky replied.

27
00:01:54.204 --> 00:01:56.882
"We can share food and have fun together.

28
00:01:56.883 --> 00:02:01.291
People Place Middle School has already chosen three cooks to compete on the show.

29
00:02:01.292 --> 00:02:06.207
Now it's Mr. Icky's turn to select one cook from Monster Academy."

30
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:08.860
"Awesome!" a mummy said.

31
00:02:08.861 --> 00:02:12.531
A werewolf howled.

32
00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:15.121
Mr. Freaky turned to Mr. Icky.

33
00:02:15.122 --> 00:02:17.864
"The whole world will be watching this show.

34
00:02:17.865 --> 00:02:20.039
Nothing can go wrong."

35
00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:29.624
The principal blew his noses again and then left the room.

36
00:02:29.625 --> 00:02:32.609
"Okay, students," Mr. Icky said.

37
00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:34.644
"Let's begin today's assignment.

38
00:02:34.645 --> 00:02:40.149
I want everyone to make their very best batch of tarantula stew."

39
00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:46.784
"This is so exciting," Winnie said to Ben as students started gathering ingredients from the pantry.

40
00:02:46.785 --> 00:02:50.691
"Can you imagine being on Kids' Kitchen Showdown

41
00:02:50.692 --> 00:02:54.843
?" "Yeah," Ben said with a

42
00:02:54.844 --> 00:02:58.001
groan. "I can imagine it as the worst thing in the

43
00:02:58.002 --> 00:03:02.620
world." Winnie laughed. "I know you don't like

44
00:03:02.621 --> 00:03:04.500
cooking. But you're better at it than you

45
00:03:04.501 --> 00:03:08.701
think. And we need people to see that monsters make good food

46
00:03:08.702 --> 00:03:12.632
too." Ben just rolled his eyes and reached for his

47
00:03:12.633 --> 00:03:16.746
apron. Usually tarantula stew contained moldy

48
00:03:16.747 --> 00:03:22.654
peaches. But by the time Ben looked in the pantry, the peaches were all

49
00:03:22.655 --> 00:03:26.179
gone. He saw some rotten nectarines with

50
00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:31.994
worms. "Nectarines are sort of like peaches," Ben

51
00:03:31.995 --> 00:03:36.407
thought. He chopped the nectarines and dumped them into his

52
00:03:36.408 --> 00:03:38.472
pot. He dropped the worms in

53
00:03:38.473 --> 00:03:43.268
too. Then he added some fresh tarantula legs and

54
00:03:43.269 --> 00:03:49.339
cinnamon. As he mixed the sauce, green vapors rose from the

55
00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:51.510
surface. "Oh, boy," Ben

56
00:03:51.511 --> 00:03:55.224
thought. "Tarantula stew isn't supposed to look like

57
00:03:55.225 --> 00:03:59.809
this. I messed up!" He looked around the

58
00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:03.032
classroom. Everyone was busy

59
00:04:03.033 --> 00:04:04.936
working. Ben looked into his pot

60
00:04:04.937 --> 00:04:06.836
again. "Ack!" he

61
00:04:06.837 --> 00:04:09.874
cried. His stew was starting to burn at the

62
00:04:09.875 --> 00:04:14.393
edges. He scraped the sides of his pot, mixing the burned edges into the

63
00:04:14.394 --> 00:04:17.930
stew. The stew took on a darker color

64
00:04:17.931 --> 00:04:22.461
now. Ben sighed. "It's

65
00:04:22.462 --> 00:04:26.286
ruined." He turned off the burner on his stove and lifted the

66
00:04:26.287 --> 00:04:28.566
pot. He floated toward the garbage

67
00:04:28.567 --> 00:04:32.210
can. Mr. Icky blocked his path, looking

68
00:04:32.211 --> 00:04:35.271
stern. "You are not going to throw that

69
00:04:35.272 --> 00:04:40.992
out!" The teacher took the pot from Ben and brought it back to Ben's

70
00:04:40.993 --> 00:04:46.591
workspace. "I've watched you do that every day for the past two weeks," Mr. Icky said.

71
00:04:46.592 --> 00:04:52.413
"No more! If you throw out your food every time you mess up, you'll never improve.

72
00:04:52.414 --> 00:04:55.467
You must taste your mistakes!"

73
00:04:55.468 --> 00:04:59.718
Mr. Icky shoved a spoon toward Ben. "Taste it!"

74
00:04:59.719 --> 00:05:02.853
Ben wrinkled his nose.

75
00:05:02.854 --> 00:05:12.152
Then he dipped the spoon into the stew and tasted it.

76
00:05:12.153 --> 00:05:15.811
"I guess it's not that bad."

77
00:05:15.812 --> 00:05:18.393
"Good," Mr. Icky said.

78
00:05:18.394 --> 00:05:25.375
The teacher lifted the spoon to his lips. Suddenly he gasped.

79
00:05:25.376 --> 00:05:30.421
"Uh-oh." Ben froze. "It's even worse than I thought."

80
00:05:30.422 --> 00:05:33.165
Mr. Icky swallowed.

81
00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:34.808
He looked at the stew.

82
00:05:34.809 --> 00:05:37.544
Then he looked at Ben.

83
00:05:37.545 --> 00:05:43.507
"You used rotten nectarines, didn't you? And do I taste worms?"

84
00:05:43.508 --> 00:05:47.509
Ben winced. "Um, I guess so."

85
00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:51.555
Mr. Icky took another taste and closed his eyes.

86
00:05:51.556 --> 00:05:57.868
"This reminds me of a tarantula stew I had in Paris many years ago.

87
00:05:57.869 --> 00:06:02.236
"Monster chefs in France always use rotten nectarines.

88
00:06:02.237 --> 00:06:08.755
Ben, you are not just a cook—you are a true chef!"

89
00:06:08.756 --> 00:06:11.316
"Wh-what?" Ben stammered.

90
00:06:11.317 --> 00:06:14.068
"That's ridiculous. I don't even know how to—"

91
00:06:14.069 --> 00:06:17.290
"You have a gift, Ben," Mr. Icky said.

92
00:06:17.291 --> 00:06:27.578
"That's why I'm going to choose you to compete on Kids' Kitchen Showdown this Friday!"

